'''Above & Below''' (雲泥温泉郷 ''Undei Onsenkyō'') is the 39th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Very hard overall, with [[The Sauna Crew]] being quite easy (it can be defeated by spamming nothing but melee units like [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cats]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cats]]), but [[Steamed to Death]] compensating for it. This sub-chapter continues the trend of stages that mostly consist of one type of enemy.
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Cala Maria]]: An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Calamary]]. This enemy is single target, but has a three-part multi-hit attack with very high damage each.

